            <ArticleTitle>Position statement of the SEMI, SED, redGDPS, SEC, SEEDO, SEEN, SEMERGEN y SEMFYC.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>505-14</MedlinePgn>
